WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
[Ambient music. A beam of light opens from above.]

00:02.000 --> 00:07.400
A world apart. A little closer.
Money moves. Connection stays.

00:07.400 --> 00:10.800
Start with someone. The people who matter.

00:10.800 --> 00:15.000
A few taps. A little love.
From your world to theirs.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.800
More than money. A way to show up.

00:20.800 --> 00:26.000
XpressTend. Closer, wherever life takes you.
Your world. Connected.
